    <item>
      <title>‘Alright mate?’ 亚马逊 Alexa 喜提 AI 灵魂：从“大号闹钟”到“贴心损友”的进阶之路</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/alright-mate-alexa-ai--20260319141006074-0/</link>
